      },
      "content": "For overhauling and for preventive maintenance, a wide range of service kits is available. Service kits comprise all parts required for servicing the component and offer the benefits of genuine Atlas Copco parts while keeping the maintenance budget low."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0956",
      "reading_order": 1372,
