      "bbox": {
        "l": 90.5697,
        "t": 670.2012,
        "r": 524.150099999999,
        "b": 645.1244999999999
      },
      "content": "Also a full range of extensively tested lubricants, suitable for your specific needs is available to keep the compressor in excellent condition."
    },
